      "time": 240
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふぅ……\r\nどうだったかしら、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040120"
  },
  {
    "select": "夏葉の気合いが\r\n伝わってきたよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "いつもの夏葉だな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "夏葉はどう思う？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040130,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それならよかったわ\r\n……私、この間、歌い方のことで迷っていたでしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あのときのことをずっと考えていたの\r\nそれでやっとわかったわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "きっと私は近道をしようとしてたのよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "トップアイドルになるためには近道なんてない\r\nあたりまえの努力をただ積み重ねていくだけなのに……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あのときのプロデューサーが伝えたかったこと……\r\nそういうことよね？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉がそう思うなら、きっとそれが答えだな",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ。自分の間違いに気づくことができたわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "これからはもう近道なんて\r\n恥ずかしいことは２度と考えない",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "迷わずトップへの道を進んでいくわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040210"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "迷いがない姿勢は、まさに夏葉だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それならいいの\r\nずっと私らしいやり方を考えていたから",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "歌い方に悩んだあのとき、\r\n私は誰かの真似をしようとしていたわ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、それは間違いだったのよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "答えが、出たんだな",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、私にとって何よりも大切なことは……\r\nただ地道に、１歩ずつ努力をしていくことだったのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040260,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それがやっとわかったから\r\nプロデューサーに見てほしかったの",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040270,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、私はもう迷わないわ\r\n安易な手段に頼ろうなんて愚かなことも２度としない",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040280,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私はこのやり方で、真正面から\r\nトップアイドル道を突き進んでいくのよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（しっかりと悩んで、自分で答えを出したようだな\r\nこの経験はきっと大きな自信につながるだろう）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（夏葉はこれからもっともっと\r\n輝きを増していくに違いない）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040290,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "これが私よ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040300,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "できないことも足りないこともあるけど\r\nでもそれもひっくるめて私なの",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040310,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私は私だもの、\r\n他の誰かになんてなれないわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040320,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そんなことより、ただひたすらに\r\n自分を磨けばいいだけなのよね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040330,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "もう迷いはないから安心して\r\n私は私なりの輝きでトップアイドルを目指すわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それはよかった",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかし何かアドバイスできればと思ってたけど\r\n必要なかったな。役に立たなくてごめん",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040340,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "なに言ってるのよ。私は私なんだからって\r\n自信をもたせてくれたのはプロデューサーじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300104/1013001040340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001040350,
